{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seed World</strong> is a casual, level-based game that incorporates Roguelike elements, with a focus on relaxed cultivation gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players will select equipment and configure their team, which serves as the main combat force for clearing levels. By equipping items and assembling a team\u2014including various types of gear such as buff equipment, debuff equipment, and more\u2014players can combine different team compositions to enhance their combat power and challenge increasingly powerful enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment:</strong><br><br>Equipment can increase attributes such as damage, health, attack range, and more. Different pets should be equipped with different gear based on their characteristics.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/91b07435f03b48a48b75c3fcea685839.avif?t=1768555696\" width=219 height=179 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/46eb028e04777f9800f06beb56319d0a.avif?t=1768555696\" width=215 height=198 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/66c3ce0f5cfec296007ad3844da58f45.avif?t=1768555696\" width=200 height=217 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat:</strong><br><br>Combat is centered around pets. Players must maintain distance from enemies to avoid attacks, while pets will block all enemies for the player.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pets:</strong><br><br>Pets can be leveled up, transformed, or released. Each pet has a unique combat style, and players can intervene to some extent in their pets' battles. Pets will fall after taking a certain amount of damage, losing their combat ability, after which enemies will directly target the player.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/d65ee54bfa4a48da6eb5d9b825b12055.avif?t=1768555696\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/326ee4ba27b86dda21c13a551722cdf0.avif?t=1768555696\" width=209 height=252 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/78cf5dfaf6a1a044ea05cb84b47d99d7.avif?t=1768555696\" width=233 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong><br><br>There are various types of enemies, especially elite enemies, which should be prioritized. Their abilities are extraordinary.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/b000319678b78be3c33f9e7e055cff44.avif?t=1768555696\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/8a5a6b19e2e07a947b7d599825632a72.avif?t=1768555696\" width=202 height=164 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Reactions:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/f720d110c469dbcc3b84423b475f5829.avif?t=1768555696\" width=80 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/b97156a4022500dc928c8e9b59cf7037.webp?t=1768555696\" width=54 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/de9b9972f1a804e8e99ca1f8d7eda068.avif?t=1768555696\" width=70 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different pets' attacks have different attributes, and these attributes can trigger elemental reactions between enemies, which are very useful in combat.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768080?t=1768555696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/f009890b2db2d6a342ab51328c5a51422dd23b94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768555696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/f5c53129ab5913a5748e7568bfd4f099ca5c968d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768555696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/f5c53129ab5913a5748e7568bfd4f099ca5c968d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768555696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seed World</strong> is a casual, level-based game that incorporates Roguelike elements, with a focus on relaxed cultivation gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players will select equipment and configure their team, which serves as the main combat force for clearing levels. By equipping items and assembling a team\u2014including various types of gear such as buff equipment, debuff equipment, and more\u2014players can combine different team compositions to enhance their combat power and challenge increasingly powerful enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment:</strong><br><br>Equipment can increase attributes such as damage, health, attack range, and more. Different pets should be equipped with different gear based on their characteristics.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/91b07435f03b48a48b75c3fcea685839.avif?t=1768555696\" width=219 height=179 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/46eb028e04777f9800f06beb56319d0a.avif?t=1768555696\" width=215 height=198 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/66c3ce0f5cfec296007ad3844da58f45.avif?t=1768555696\" width=200 height=217 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat:</strong><br><br>Combat is centered around pets. Players must maintain distance from enemies to avoid attacks, while pets will block all enemies for the player.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pets:</strong><br><br>Pets can be leveled up, transformed, or released. Each pet has a unique combat style, and players can intervene to some extent in their pets' battles. Pets will fall after taking a certain amount of damage, losing their combat ability, after which enemies will directly target the player.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/d65ee54bfa4a48da6eb5d9b825b12055.avif?t=1768555696\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/326ee4ba27b86dda21c13a551722cdf0.avif?t=1768555696\" width=209 height=252 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/78cf5dfaf6a1a044ea05cb84b47d99d7.avif?t=1768555696\" width=233 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong><br><br>There are various types of enemies, especially elite enemies, which should be prioritized. Their abilities are extraordinary.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/b000319678b78be3c33f9e7e055cff44.avif?t=1768555696\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/8a5a6b19e2e07a947b7d599825632a72.avif?t=1768555696\" width=202 height=164 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Reactions:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/f720d110c469dbcc3b84423b475f5829.avif?t=1768555696\" width=80 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/b97156a4022500dc928c8e9b59cf7037.webp?t=1768555696\" width=54 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/extras/de9b9972f1a804e8e99ca1f8d7eda068.avif?t=1768555696\" width=70 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different pets' attacks have different attributes, and these attributes can trigger elemental reactions between enemies, which are very useful in combat.</p>","developers":["\u5927\u98de\u673a\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4\uff08AirGroup)"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/63f83fe3a6994f1c1ec32f2d5e85ea68c5f2cd14/header.jpg?t=1768555696","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768080/951939806/9687abbba9586fbe99790d806a465e81a71b1646/1768397782/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768399653","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768080/951939806/9687abbba9586fbe99790d806a465e81a71b1646/1768397782/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768399653","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768080/951939806/9687abbba9586fbe99790d806a465e81a71b1646/1768397782/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768399653","id":257264758,"name":"SeedWorld","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257264758/8c8b6195af46ad497302a2260edee8b35c66996e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768399653"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768080/1971815284/15027b66dc6da35ba1b93d703154272a918e5319/1768397770/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768399655","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768080/1971815284/15027b66dc6da35ba1b93d703154272a918e5319/1768397770/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768399655","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768080/1971815284/15027b66dc6da35ba1b93d703154272a918e5319/1768397770/hls_264_maste